Artificial Intelligence (AI) -> The broad field of making machines perform intelligent tasks

Machine Learning (ML)   --> subset of ai
Learns patterns from data.
Example: Predicting customer loan default risk.

Deep Learning (DL)  ---> subset of ML
Uses multi-layer neural networks to learn complex patterns.
Example: Recognizing faces or understanding speech.

Generative AI (GenAI)   --> Much modern GenAI uses deep learning.
Generates new content such as text, images, audio or code.
Example: An LLM generating an answer to a customer query.

#GenAI is not strictly limited to deep learning in every possible approach, but modern LLMs and image generators are deep-learning systems.

Remember: AI is the broad field. ML is one approach within AI. Deep learning is one approach within ML. GenAI focuses on generating content and commonly uses deep learning.
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A. Artificial Intelligence (AI)
AI refers to systems that perform tasks associated with human intelligence, such as reasoning, planning, perception or decision-making.
Example: A rule-based system that routes banking support tickets to the correct department can be an AI application.

B. Machine Learning (ML)
ML algorithms learn patterns from examples instead of requiring every decision rule to be written manually.
Example: Predicting whether a customer may miss a loan payment using historical customer and repayment data.


C. Deep Learning (DL)
DL uses neural networks with multiple layers to learn complex representations from data.
Example: Detecting patterns in images of identity documents or transcribing customer speech.


D. Generative AI (GenAI)
GenAI creates content based on learned patterns and a user's prompt or other input.
Example: Generating a summary of a banking support incident, drafting an email or answering questions using a bank's approved documents.

Concept  |	Main purpose  |	Example
AI	      |Perform intelligent tasks	|  Route a support ticket
ML	      |Learn patterns and predict	 |Predict loan default risk
Deep       | Learning	Learn complex patterns with neural networks| 	Recognize text in identity documents
